Why?

Because administrator activity has a higher security impact.

Example:

Someone changes Conditional Access.

Someone modifies a privileged role.

Someone changes security configuration.

A long audit trail helps during forensic investigation.

🥈 REAL-TIME POLICY PATTERN #2
💰 Financial / Regulatory Users

Suppose a company has a regulatory requirement around financial operations.

They might identify:

